{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pied à Terre — Proposal"}]},{"type":"horizontalRule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hi Andrea,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Thank you for our Google Meet and for walking me through Pied à Terre, your brand, and your goal to keep the full guest journey — from inspiration to confirmed booking — in your own identity. You have already shared your "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"brand book"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"all marketing-site pages styled in Adobe XD"},{"type":"text","text":" — that is a strong head start. Phase 1 is therefore focused on faithful build and launch, not reinventing the visual design. Brand experience and hospitality brands are exactly the kind of challenge I enjoy: design, engineering, and conversion aligned in one line."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Short answer to your main question:"},{"type":"text","text":" yes, a fully native booking flow on top of Guesty is feasible. Search, availability, pricing, checkout, and confirmation can stay on the Pied à Terre website, in your custom design, with real-time sync to Airbnb, Booking.com, and other channels through Guesty — no redirect to a generic booking portal and no parallel systems."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"This proposal deliberately splits the work into "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"two phases"},{"type":"text","text":". Phase 1 delivers a production-ready marketing website; phase 2 builds the native booking flow with Guesty integration. That way you can go live with the brand quickly, while the technical booking scope lands in a second, agreed step."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Investment in two phases"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixed price"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Delivery"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"1"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Marketing website — build from Adobe XD + brand book, all designed pages, Cloudflare launch"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"€ 5,000"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null,"align":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Live on your domain once you are happy with the build and sign off"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"